  "problem": "Package union is applicability metadata, not an identity or leaf-admission boundary. Scoped commands misclassified an owned unbound definition as unknown404; clears/unassign could accept200 when another type alone kept the definition in the union. Encoded node validation also used that union before current leaf admission.",
  "change": "Use the existing actual Source target read for the seven current point-command preflights. Rename the internal estimateTarget method to stepTarget; encoded node validation delegates to that same target, preserving rolled_up refusal. Ordinary pair parent clears retain their existing no-op behavior. Existing leaf-target lifetime and native writer admission are retained; no Source, authority flag or fallback catalogue is substituted.",
